# Catalog and live data are off-limits

The store catalog is set. Do not change it.

Never PATCH, POST, or DELETE live Railway admin data: products, collections, sales, hero, reviews, help, settings, orders, customers.

Never edit `backend/data/*.json` unless the user explicitly asks to change catalog data.

Never restore, revert, seed, or "sync" catalog from git, Cloudinary, or screenshots unless the user explicitly asks.

Code, UI, and deploy work is fine. Leave the live database and catalog files alone.
